{"unit_id":"vlln__dsh-autofork#card-zh","repo":"vlln/dsh-autofork","commit":"6c7f83cbde1f87d3902d66a23996eabed5a04857","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-autofork 是面向 DSH Web 的会话分叉插件。agent 正在处理任务时，它可将新指令交给新会话，让旧会话继续运行，并把完成结果回传。插件在 DSH 中接入自动或手动分叉流程，向新会话提供已完成上下文与在途进度摘要，并通过 fork_list、fork_send、fork_cancel 管理家族会话。浏览器端还提供分叉关系页签，可查看会话状态、触发原因并切换会话。适合需要在长任务执行期间继续交流或协调多个会话的 DSH 用户；需要 DSH Web 环境，不要求额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:176","src/tools.mjs:158-224","src/digest.mjs:391","client/index.js:2877-2905"]}
{"unit_id":"vlln__dsh-autofork#card-en","repo":"vlln/dsh-autofork","commit":"6c7f83cbde1f87d3902d66a23996eabed5a04857","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-autofork forks a busy DSH Web session so new instructions can be handled while the original task continues and returns its result. It provides progress summaries, tools for managing related sessions, and a browser tab to view and switch between them. No extra API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:176","src/tools.mjs:158-224","src/digest.mjs:391","client/index.js:2877-2905"]}
